{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02815","headline":"西使兼送孟学士南游 · 卢照邻","name":"西使兼送孟学士南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地道巴陵北，天山弱水东。\n相看万余里，共倚一征蓬。\n零雨悲王粲，清尊别孔融。\n裴回闻夜鹤，怅望待秋鸿。\n骨肉胡秦外，风尘关塞中。\n唯余剑锋在，耿耿气成虹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}